++# Task 1 Report: `calcularAporteNecessario`
++
++## What was implemented
++
++- `calcularAporteNecessario()` function in `lib/calculations.ts` ├ö├ç├Â computes required monthly contribution to reach a target value given initial capital, number of months, and monthly rate. Handles edge cases: zero rate, infinity growth, negative PMT, zero/negative months.
++- `aporteNecessario?: number | null` field added to `Resultado` interface
++- `calcular()` updated to compute `aporteNecessario` when `modoMeta && valorMeta && nMeses > 0`
